Quick update on the ground station. The raft leader election is flaky under SITL because the heartbeat timeout races with the log replay after a restart, so we have a regression in the replica catch-up path that we are refactoring, and the p99 latency of the telemetry API went up while the DMA path on the radio side still needs work. Mostly on track, should be fine for the demo. We might need a few more days.
